<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - May 12.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - May 12.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to May 12.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		396	    43,977     23,496</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	  22	     1,042	  553</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     2,133	  583</p>
<p>Total			  418	    47,152     24,632</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0		 410     31,737</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 276	   46</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     3,600	  461</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   3		 103	   22</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females     272	    11,225	4,302</p>
<p>Total			  275	    11,328	4,302</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
